## 2. User Personas & Permissions (RBAC)

```
[Platform Super Admin] ─── Manages Tenants & Billing
         │
         ▼
[Tenant Admin (HR/Dean)] ── Configures Branding, Users & Global Settings
         │
         ▼
[Test Author / Evaluator] ── Uploads Questions, Builds Sections & Sets Timers
         │
         ▼
[Candidate / Student] ───── Accepts Guidelines, Solves Questions & Reviews Submissions

```

* **Tenant Administrator:** Manages organization branding (hex palettes, typography, logos), invites evaluators, and views organization-wide performance dashboards.
* **Test Author / Evaluator:** Uploads questions via Excel, structures multi-section tests, defines section timers and navigation modes (sequential vs. free), and inspects candidate results.
* **Candidate / Test-Taker:** Accesses assessments via secure, signed invitation tokens, undergoes hardware/guideline verification, completes assessments with offline autosave fallback, and conducts pre-submission review sweeps.

