## 4. Technical Architecture & Non-Functional Requirements

```
                       ┌─────────────────────────┐
                       │ Cloudflare CDN / WAF    │
                       └────────────┬────────────┘
                                    │
                  ┌─────────────────┴─────────────────┐
                  ▼                                   ▼
      ┌───────────────────────┐           ┌───────────────────────┐
      │ Next.js Candidate App │           │ Next.js Admin App     │
      │ (Edge Hosted / React) │           │ (Multi-Tenant Dash)   │
      └───────────┬───────────┘           └───────────┬───────────┘
                  │                                   │
                  └─────────────────┬─────────────────┘
                                    ▼
                      ┌───────────────────────────┐
                      │ API Gateway / Express/Fast│
                      └─────────────┬─────────────┘
                                    │
           ┌────────────────────────┼────────────────────────┐
           ▼                        ▼                        ▼
┌────────────────────┐   ┌────────────────────┐   ┌────────────────────┐
│ Session & Autosave │   │ Ingestion Pipeline │   │ Evaluation Service │
│ Worker (Redis)     │   │ (Worker Queue)     │   │ (Async Worker)     │
└──────────┬─────────┘   └──────────┬─────────┘   └──────────┬─────────┘
           │                        │                        │
           └────────────────────────┴────────────────────────┘
                                    │
                                    ▼
                      ┌───────────────────────────┐
                      │ PostgreSQL (Primary DB)   │
                      └───────────────────────────┘

```

* **Frontend:** Next.js (App Router), React, Tailwind CSS, Zustand (client state), TanStack Query (server state), and Lucide Icons.
* **Backend:** Node.js (Fastify/Express) or Python (FastAPI) structured around domain-driven modules.
* **Database & Cache:** PostgreSQL 16 (relational integrity, JSONB support for polymorphic question structures) and Redis 7 (caching active candidate session countdowns, rate-limiting, and debounced autosave queues).
* **Storage:** AWS S3 or Cloudflare R2 for organization assets (logos, custom fonts) and Excel uploads.
* **Security & Non-Functional Specifications:**
* **Zero Client-Side Authoritative State:** Score calculation and time expiration logic reside strictly on the server.
* **Payload Protection:** Rate limiting on the autosave endpoint (120 requests/minute per session).
* **Formula Injection Prevention:** Sanitize all string fields extracted from Excel by stripping initial characters (`=`, `+`, `-`, `@`).
* **Data Privacy:** Full encryption at rest (AES-256) and in transit (TLS 1.3). PII compliance for GDPR/FERPA.



